      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to call but it doesn't change the reality. even if i talk to someone, tomorrow is still gonna be the same. the same demands, the same crushing feeling of being stuck in a life that isn't even mine anymore. it feels like no matter how much i try to \"surface,\" the current just pulls me back down. it's just... permanent. it feels like there's no actual exit from this cycle.",
